window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-006-f301eadf7a446a09.json"]={sha256:"f301eadf7a446a09ec20d192a728be7359948b9c5e78350bb090fbdcfaead0c2",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-9e49b6e057aee700","url":"https://docs.cloud.google.com/iam/docs/best-practices-for-using-workload-identity-federation","title":"Best practices for Workload Identity Federation","titleEn":"Best practices for Workload Identity Federation","publisher":"Google Cloud","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-006","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-006","related":[{"id":"security-v27-007","referenceUrls":["https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/oidc"],"title":"GitHub OIDC：部署環境與 reusable workflow 身分","titleEn":"GitHub OIDC: deployment environments and reusable workflow identity","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：兩租戶同名反例不通過，50%與31.25%使用固定分母；簽章驗證、映射與授權三階段均有證據。 交付16列tenant-map.csv、碰撞對照與五筆最終允許集合；保留被拒絕的同名外部租戶案例。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Same-name cross-tenant counterexamples are denied;50% and 31.25% use a fixed denominator. Evidence covers signature validation, identity mapping and authorization as three separate stages. Deliver 16 tenant-map rows, the collision comparison and the final five-row allow set. Retain the rejected same-name external-tenant example as a mandatory regression fixture.","difference":"製作12筆main、pull request、production environment與重用workflow的claim描述；畫出repo、environment、workflow reference各自由誰控制，不使用真實token。","differenceEn":"Prepare 12 claim descriptors spanning main, pull requests, production environment and a reusable workflow. Identify who controls repository, environment and workflow reference, using no live token.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["映射身分與授權條件是不同層次；不可因簽章來自共同issuer就信任其所有租戶。組織識別使用固定測試ID，顯示名稱只作說明。 共16筆，單看共同issuer全數符合；加上A組織條件後8筆符合，再加受控repository條件只剩5筆。 組織限定後8/16×100=50%；再限定repository後5/16×100=31.25%。縮小可用集合不是偵測率或服務可用性量測。","雲端信任條件必須與實際subject樣板一致；environment不能被推論成分支仍在subject內。固定workflow版本與受眾條件分開檢查。 12筆中6筆符合repo與production環境；加入既定reusable workflow SHA要求後只有4筆符合；所有token描述皆採相同受眾。 環境條件覆蓋6/12×100=50%；完整workflow條件4/12×100=33.3333333%。沒有把PR事件自動當可信部署。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Identity mapping and authorization conditions are distinct layers. Trusting a shared issuer's signature does not authorize every tenant. Use fixed fictional organization IDs; display names are explanatory metadata, not the sole trust anchor. All 16 fixtures match the common issuer. Requiring organization A leaves eight; additionally requiring the approved repository leaves five. Every count refers to this enumerated synthetic set. Organization restriction gives 8/16×100=50%; adding repository restriction gives 5/16×100=31.25%. This reduced eligible set is neither a detection rate nor a measured service-availability figure.","Cloud trust conditions must match the actual subject template. An environment context does not imply the branch remains encoded in the subject. Verify pinned workflow identity and audience independently. Six of 12 rows satisfy repository and production-environment conditions. Adding the approved reusable-workflow SHA requirement leaves four; all token descriptors share the same configured audience. The environment conditions admit 6/12×100=50%; the complete workflow conditions admit 4/12×100=33.3333333%. A pull-request event is never automatically treated as a trusted deployment.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-016","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9180.html"],"title":"HPKE：上下文綁定與封裝負擔","titleEn":"HPKE: context binding and encapsulation overhead","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：兩租戶同名反例不通過，50%與31.25%使用固定分母；簽章驗證、映射與授權三階段均有證據。 交付16列tenant-map.csv、碰撞對照與五筆最終允許集合；保留被拒絕的同名外部租戶案例。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Same-name cross-tenant counterexamples are denied;50% and 31.25% use a fixed denominator. Evidence covers signature validation, identity mapping and authorization as three separate stages. Deliver 16 tenant-map rows, the collision comparison and the final five-row allow set. Retain the rejected same-name external-tenant example as a mandatory regression fixture.","difference":"定義固定測試套件、接收者測試公鑰、info與AAD；以不同租戶、訊息用途及內容類型建立負例，不使用真實秘密或自創密碼演算法。","differenceEn":"Define a fixed test suite, recipient test public key, info and AAD. Create tenant, message-purpose and content-type counterexamples using inert data and an established implementation rather than inventing cryptographic primitives.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["映射身分與授權條件是不同層次；不可因簽章來自共同issuer就信任其所有租戶。組織識別使用固定測試ID，顯示名稱只作說明。 共16筆，單看共同issuer全數符合；加上A組織條件後8筆符合，再加受控repository條件只剩5筆。 組織限定後8/16×100=50%；再限定repository後5/16×100=31.25%。縮小可用集合不是偵測率或服務可用性量測。","info在設定時綁定應用上下文，AAD在訊息認證中綁定額外資料；本課的封裝長度與標籤長度為指定套件假設，不能推廣為所有HPKE組合。 單筆訊息明文1000位元組，封裝公鑰32位元組，AEAD標籤16位元組；暫不計序列化、傳輸標頭及重用上下文。 額外負擔(32+16)/1000×100=4.8%；明文縮至250位元組而其他固定時，負擔為19.2%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Identity mapping and authorization conditions are distinct layers. Trusting a shared issuer's signature does not authorize every tenant. Use fixed fictional organization IDs; display names are explanatory metadata, not the sole trust anchor. All 16 fixtures match the common issuer. Requiring organization A leaves eight; additionally requiring the approved repository leaves five. Every count refers to this enumerated synthetic set. Organization restriction gives 8/16×100=50%; adding repository restriction gives 5/16×100=31.25%. This reduced eligible set is neither a detection rate nor a measured service-availability figure.","Bind application context during setup through info and message metadata through AAD. Encapsulation and authentication-tag lengths below are assumptions for the selected suite, not universal sizes for every HPKE combination or mode. For one independently encapsulated message use 1000 plaintext bytes, 32 encapsulation bytes and a 16-byte AEAD tag. Exclude serialization, transport headers and reused-context amortization so the scope of the overhead calculation remains explicit. Relative overhead is (32+16)/1000×100=4.8 percent. Reducing plaintext to 250 bytes while holding encapsulation and tag sizes fixed gives 19.2 percent; this compares added bytes with plaintext, not with total wire size.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-80fe11d8c90dc34c","url":"https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/security/oidc","title":"GitHub Actions OpenID Connect reference","titleEn":"GitHub Actions OpenID Connect reference","publisher":"GitHub","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-0a869a40fea35016","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9180.html","title":"RFC 9180: Hybrid Public Key Encryption","titleEn":"RFC 9180: Hybrid Public Key Encryption","publisher":"IRTF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
